     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_1" loext:marker-style-name="T103"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660009" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">3.<text:span text:style-name="T107"> </text:span>Installing the app on your phone<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 21</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_1" loext:marker-style-name="T103"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660010" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.<text:span text:style-name="T107"> </text:span>Frequently Asked Questions<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 25</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660011" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.1.<text:span text:style-name="T108"> </text:span>What sort of apps can I build?<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 25</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_3" loext:marker-style-name="T105"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660012" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.1.1.<text:span text:style-name="T109"> </text:span>Picture Storybook apps<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 25</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_3" loext:marker-style-name="T105"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660013" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.1.2.<text:span text:style-name="T109"> </text:span>A collection of Bloom books<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 26</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_3" loext:marker-style-name="T105"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660014" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.1.3.<text:span text:style-name="T109"> </text:span>Song Book apps<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 26</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_3" loext:marker-style-name="T105"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660015" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.1.4.<text:span text:style-name="T109"> </text:span>Quiz apps<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 26</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_3" loext:marker-style-name="T105"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660016" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.1.5.<text:span text:style-name="T109"> </text:span>Hybrid apps (combining different types of resources)<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 27</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660017" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link"><text:soft-page-break/>4.2.<text:span text:style-name="T108"> </text:span>How can I contextualize my app for a specific audience?<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 27</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660018" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.3.<text:span text:style-name="T108"> </text:span>How can I find the setting or feature that I need in my RAB project?<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 27</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660019" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.4.<text:span text:style-name="T108"> </text:span>How should I choose the app package name?<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 28</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660020" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.5.<text:span text:style-name="T108"> </text:span>How can I add audio to my app?<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 28</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660021" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.6.<text:span text:style-name="T108"> </text:span>How can I synchronize the text and audio in my app (creating timing files)?<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 28</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660022" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.7.<text:span text:style-name="T108"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">Do I have to create a new keystore for each app?</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T118"> 28</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660023" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.8.<text:span text:style-name="T108"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T36">How can I include pictures in my apps?</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T118"> 28</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_2" loext:marker-style-name="T104"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660024" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.9.<text:span text:style-name="T108"> </text:span>How can I handle a “right-to-left” language?<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 29</text:span></text:a></text:p>
     <text:p text:style-name="Contents_20_3" loext:marker-style-name="T105"><text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#_Toc233660025" text:style-name="Index_20_Link" text:visited-style-name="Index_20_Link">4.9.1.<text:span text:style-name="T109"> </text:span>Setting the UI layout direction<text:span text:style-name="T118"> 29</text:span></text:a></text:p>
