   <text:h text:style-name="P60" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="_Poetry_Styles"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc233660271"/>Poetry Styles<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc233660271"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">Most of these poetry styles relate directly to styles in the <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://ubsicap.github.io/usfm/usfm3.0.3/index.html" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link"><text:span text:style-name="Internet_20_link">USFM documentation</text:span></text:a>.</text:p>
