   <text:h text:style-name="P61" text:outline-level="2"><text:bookmark text:name="_Annotations_Styles"/><text:bookmark-start text:name="_Toc233660285"/>Annotations Styles<text:bookmark-end text:name="_Toc233660285"/></text:h>
   <text:p text:style-name="Standard">These are used for formatting elements of the Notes and Bookmarks features, including the position of the icons and the appearance of the Notes and Bookmarks lists under the navigation drawer menu.</text:p>
